OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells this
OL,7,Fafternoon. A few scattered showers,
OL,8,Fbut these dying out from the west
OL,9,Fduring by mid-afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,12,FSome light and patchy rain will spread
OL,13,Feast overnight for a time. A few
OL,14,Fshowers continuing across the west
OL,15,Fotherwise becoming dry.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FSome early brightness in the
OL,18,Feast. Otherwise rather cloudy with
OL,19,Foutbreaks of rain spreading east for a
OL,20,Ftime.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
